<h2>Security notes</h2>
<div class="callout callout-warning">
  <div class="callout-icon">⚠️</div>
  <div class="callout-content">
    <div class="callout-title">Do not share caching instances across users or tenants</div>
    <p>Cache keys do not isolate principals by default. In SSR or multi-user server contexts, use separate retryer instances per user, or disable caching for personalized endpoints. The default <code>skipWhenAuthPresent: true</code> is a safety net, not a guarantee.</p>
  </div>
</div>

